===Etymology===
From {{af|en|nature|-o-|-pathy}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|alternative medicine}} A system of [[therapy]] that avoids drugs and surgery and emphasizes the use of natural remedies (air, water, heat, sunshine) and physical means (massage, electrical treatment) to treat illness.

